        "sys_wild_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Blowpipe grass is a common Gu refinement material, and a large expanse of it slowly gives birth to some sound path and wood path Gu worms.",
      "chapters": [
        476
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "what-the-path-governs",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "res_blowpipe_grass",
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Qin Bai Sheng’s auction, metal, wood, water, fire, and earth are named more popular than cloud path and sound path.",
      "chapters": [
        752
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "what-the-path-governs",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_bai_sheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At a Refinement Path Convention round, the eighth task is to refine keep silent Gu, a rank five sound path Gu worm, with limited materials that force reverse-refinement of apathy Gu, muted mouth Gu, or sinking Gu. Firesmith Dragon Chief is a fire path Gu Immortal most proficient in refining fire path Gu worms, and this sound path Gu worm falls outside that proficiency, with crucial materials he cannot handle by fire refinement techniques.",
      "chapters": [
        841
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "keep-silent-gu-task",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_refinement_path_convention",
        "char_firesmith_dragon_chief",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Feng Jiu Ge loved music when young and did not hesitate to cultivate sound path, aiming to create nine songs that express himself, all living beings, and heaven and earth. After that, he found the inheritance of sound path great expert Spatial Sound Immortal Master in a mountain valley, cultivated there alone, and became a rank six Gu Immortal without causing a commotion.",
      "chapters": [
        1965
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
